comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T10:53:00.389Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: request-specific live search plus fresh open/in_progress lists and the complete3074-item all-status snapshot found no existing owner for these new package commands. Read the closed calendar grammar precedent and live grammar parent in full. The failure is the host SDK census; both latest-package commands register and expose valid help, and changelog generation/check/audit already work. Pair this integration repair with pm-gh1555 and pm-t2dqzijokl31 in the same PR."
  "2026-10-23T10:57:01.067Z","harness:codex","Negative control: the unchanged latest-package runtime produced missing_destination for changelog audit and changelog milestone create plus stale_observed_signature for both. The published package already declares audit with no positional operands and milestone create with required name. Add only host-owned package destinations and that exact required-name slot; retain package generation code, activation contracts, grammar budgets and inactive-package semantics."
  "2026-10-23T11:12:12.021Z","harness:codex","Current live grammar conformance passes:235 declared and235 observed positional signatures,20 shapes within the unchanged21-shape budget, no findings. The complete local static sequence passed code, architecture, dependency feeds, package/SDK boundary, grammar and conformance stages, then identified this new item missing expected_result at the final graph stage. Corrected that metadata and recorded its genuine discovered_from link to the latest-package upgrade in pm-gh1555; rerun graph/integrity and remaining mutation gates rather than weaken policy."
  "2026-10-23T11:22:34.866Z","harness:codex",Linked command passed37 tests with a durable pass receipt. Independent installed-package command grammar has235 matching positional declarations/observations with no findings and unchanged shape budget. Final graph and record-integrity verdicts pass after expected_result and actual discovery/context relationships were recorded. The latest package remains upstream-owned and unchanged.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T11:12:11.028Z","harness:codex","Install and inspect the latest first-party package before declaring its integration healthy. The host SDK destination and positional census is a separate contract from successful package activation. Populate expected_result when creating active work, before running the repository graph-assurance gate."
